{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_007_03_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7d735317fc074598b4036684fdd9a2a0484908f4e2028dee4d886916839bb30c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57435e1ed9e97502264f08d2528869e5fb9c4cd98772fe1080622031f43ce149",
      "text": "几分钟前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f148a044dbabd1a41cc8e847a99ab859a9387f3578d2471d8d856f04d2d9b905",
      "text": "315 Production……\n名字真有趣的事务所喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66a03bc87fe583b2f6edff29ea9bea827174f7ecacb98d38e63d2b0252871458",
      "text": "如果是这里，说不定能教我\n成为偶像的方法……去也！按门铃喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000049:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3081715a7ab3f7550973d10f6272f5a1a5f7de18c4e4300a531631f1e3d704e0",
      "text": "几天前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20d5059a2a82562650a529056d8a3545e54d31825a4107cbbe2ff6e36db666bf",
      "text": "师父，刚才那段以偶像为题材的段子\n听起来怎么样喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb023f9ee964c3fea8d4c04a742e5ec3ffa372aaa67f8c0d375bbe4f6b9fe15d",
      "text": "差强人意。\n你自己也是这么觉得的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e78a5a857c3c59c946af90fcdc5a286a4cbec7a4e978dd8974640b9c08b27f9",
      "text": "无法反驳喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fefda5437a208a0d120841de169d481084fa2b26705d34f5fe96295067ed96c9",
      "text": "……所谓偶像这个题材，光凭桐生你的\n想象、知识和经验是抓不住精髓的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b24ba93b58504e8fe8c7266987251f5ec9a6010712a50c05c98b746a272ca8cc",
      "text": "这种瓶颈任何人都会遇到。\n说明现在的你还驾驭不了这个题材。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d38e6d19edc335f105d6ff9df2e4c2abc7f07f6d4e67a548b05195516c6d8567",
      "text": "原来如此……也就是说既然经验不足，去补足\n不就好了喵！去补足当偶像的经验！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ce719780b03e7a9ed745cbbe6ee7c58d329e1919f8d30c426ee1d0bfa06cc4b",
      "text": "原来打的是这个算盘。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2849e5f55a7bf9b47a5b8bc9eceb42d46a1498de6aed2e37d554e91060f62192",
      "text": "师父！吾辈要去当偶像喵！\n可以喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_h:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:553c67af032d4e38292b0fa307f930c58faeac4d20b2ff0d65815a542b828832",
      "text": "随你便。不过，我可绝不会给你任何支持。\n凭你自己的本事去闯吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
